Third-party components
================================================================================

MICM does not vendor third-party source in this repository.  The components below
are fetched at configure time by CMake (see cmake/dependencies.cmake) and are
governed by their own licenses.  Redistributing a MICM build that includes them
means redistributing those components, so their notices are reproduced by
reference here.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
